      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how deeply heavy those feelings are, and I want you to know that your pain is valid. You don't have to pretend to care or try to \"add up\" the math of a hopeless situation if it only leads to burnout. Sometimes the bravest thing we can do is take a step back from the overwhelming news to protect our own peace and make small, quiet moments of joy that feel real to us.",
